      "sequence": 88,
      "operation_number": 29,
      "type": "revelation_established",
      "revelation_id": "a-combined-security-package-can-protect-aurelune-during-the-loan",
      "supporting_clue_ids": [
        "ordinary-movement-is-not-a-border-breach"
      ],
      "note": "Substitute wards, reserve forces, a bounded term, and objective recall can reduce Dawnward risk without making the rescue revocable on alarm."
