      "type": "encounter_consequence_recorded",
      "encounter_id": "the-silent-fir-lodge",
      "text": "Serevin gives a conditional declaration for a funded reserve, an eight- to ten-day term, objective recall, and a baseline ordinary seasonal movement cannot satisfy."
