      "type": "encounter_consequence_recorded",
      "encounter_id": "the-noon-spear-court",
      "text": "Serathiel gives a conditional declaration for an eight-day campaign order, funded eastern reserve, substitute wards, and royal protection limited to damage or use beyond the undertaking."
